          "topic": "Alpha boards in the hands of testers, visible to testers, developers and admins. One post per board and revision.\nA report says: board and revision, firmware and version, the setup, what was tested, what worked and what failed, with photos, logs or a diff.",
          "forum": {
            "layout": "list",
            "sort": "activity",
            "default_reaction": "👍",
            "require_tag": true,
